# ~chamo-agent/.config/chamo-agent/agent.env (mode 600). Secrets for the developer agent.
#
# Fine-grained token, repository access: only WangMingCF/chamo.
#   Contents: read/write · Pull requests: read/write · Issues: read/write
#   Actions: read · Metadata: read
#   NOT Commit statuses (only the reviewer may set the review check), NOT Administration.
GH_TOKEN=
# The model provider key. lib.sh also refuses to publish any text containing it.
MODEL_API_KEY=
# Pass it on under whatever name your harness reads, for example:
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=${MODEL_API_KEY}
# Command for one round. It must read the prompt on stdin, work in the current
# directory (the clone), write the round report to $ROUND_REPORT and exit.
# Example shape only; replace with your harness's real flags:
HARNESS_CMD='your-harness run --goal-mode --non-interactive --prompt-stdin'
